@startuml C4-Dynamic-Search-FTS
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false

title Dynamic — Search users / posts (FTS5)

actor "用户" as user
participant "Web / Mobile" as ui <<ui>>
participant "SearchController" as searchCtrl <<java>>
participant "SearchService" as searchSvc <<java>>
database "SQLite\nFTS + tables" as db <<db>>

== 搜索用户 ==
user -> ui : 输入关键词
ui -> searchCtrl : GET /api/v1/search?type=users&q=
searchCtrl -> searchSvc : searchUsers
searchSvc -> db : MATCH users_fts\n或 LIKE users.username
db --> searchSvc : hits
searchSvc --> ui : 200 hits

== 搜索帖子 ==
ui -> searchCtrl : GET /api/v1/search?type=posts&q=
searchCtrl -> searchSvc : searchPosts
searchSvc -> db : MATCH posts_fts\n或 LIKE social_posts.caption
db --> ui : 200 hits

note over searchSvc, db
  Preferred Term: Search Scope
  (posts / users / hashtags)。
  无 Elasticsearch 依赖。
end note

@enduml
